      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cameron%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The village\u2019s early economy featured general stores, a blacksmith shop, and a hotel, while surrounding townships raised Short Horn cattle and Poland China hogs.",
